              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wasesithi kubo: Ngiqinisile ngithi kini: Lina elingilandelayo, ekuzalweni kutsha, lapho iNdodana yomuntu isihlezi esihlalweni senkazimulo yayo, lani lizahlala ezihlalweni zobukhosi ezilitshumi lambili, lahlulele izizwe ezilitshumi lambili zakoIsrayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.19.28"
            ]
          }
